1
00:00:01,910 --> 00:00:02,700
Why?

2
00:00:03,450 --> 00:00:04,660
What's going on?

3
00:00:05,450 --> 00:00:09,290
All the moe is gone from Akiba?

4
00:00:09,290 --> 00:00:11,840
Okarin, wait up!

5
00:00:10,540 --> 00:00:11,840
Okarin!

6
00:00:11,840 --> 00:00:13,550
What's wrong?

7
00:00:13,550 --> 00:00:15,710
Where's the Tora no Ana? The Animate?

8
00:00:16,510 --> 00:00:18,380
The Mandarake? The Gamers?

9
00:00:18,380 --> 00:00:20,180
What are you talking about, Okarin?

10
00:00:20,180 --> 00:00:22,640
Why would those be in Akiba?

11
00:00:22,640 --> 00:00:25,930
That's why I'm going to Nakano to get my doujinshi.

12
00:00:25,060 --> 00:00:25,930
Mayuri,

13
00:00:25,930 --> 00:00:28,230
you work part-time at May Queen, right?

14
00:00:29,190 --> 00:00:31,180
May Queen?

15
00:00:31,180 --> 00:00:32,890
May Queen Nyan Nyan!

16
00:00:36,400 --> 00:00:37,350
Impossible...

17
00:00:37,350 --> 00:00:41,810
<i>Feyris was the one who asked to bring moe culture to Akiba.</i>

18
00:00:43,070 --> 00:00:46,570
<i>She sent a D-mail, preventing that from ever happening?</i>

19
00:00:48,160 --> 00:00:50,080
<i>With just one message,</i>

20
00:00:50,500 --> 00:00:53,040
<i>the whole town changed.</i>

