00:18:45,040 --> 00:18:47,970
Goodbye

743
00:18:47,120 --> 00:18:47,910
Darn her!

744
00:18:56,460 --> 00:19:00,050
Does she plan to leave this city, by herself?

745
00:19:00,840 --> 00:19:05,010
I, Hououin Kyouma, will not allow that!

746
00:19:09,510 --> 00:19:10,760
Damn it!

747
00:19:10,760 --> 00:19:11,890
Where did she go?

748
00:19:13,350 --> 00:19:14,390
<i>That's right...</i>

749
00:19:14,390 --> 00:19:17,190
<i>If I send a D-mail, telling myself to follow her,</i>

750
00:19:17,190 --> 00:19:19,270
<i>no matter what, this afternoon...</i>

751
00:19:19,730 --> 00:19:20,770
<i>But...</i>

752
00:19:22,230 --> 00:19:25,320
<i>Is it right for me to use the D-mail</i>

753
00:19:25,860 --> 00:19:27,820
<i>to change the past any more?</i>

754
00:19:27,820 --> 00:19:30,080
<i>You're a good person, you know that?</i>

755
00:19:30,830 --> 00:19:34,910
<i>I feel a bit better now, somehow.</i>

756
00:19:36,920 --> 00:19:41,800
<i>I am the great Mad Scientist, Hououin Kyouma!</i>

757
00:19:41,800 --> 00:19:44,550
What have I to fear?

758
00:19:58,850 --> 00:20:00,650
Do not give in to your assistant's threats.

759
00:20:02,110 --> 00:20:04,210
Do not give in to your assistant's threats.
Follow Suzuha!

760
00:20:02,320 --> 00:20:03,780
Follow Suzuha!

