00:20:24,000 --> 00:20:25,130
Yo.

762
00:20:26,630 --> 00:20:28,340
Good morning, part-time warrior.

763
00:20:28,340 --> 00:20:29,340
Slacking off?

764
00:20:29,340 --> 00:20:32,550
Last night, we were all up really late.

765
00:20:32,550 --> 00:20:34,810
I'm so tired.

766
00:20:35,560 --> 00:20:37,430
Last night,

767
00:20:37,430 --> 00:20:41,060
we had a last supper for you,

768
00:20:41,060 --> 00:20:42,900
so you could be our guinea pig.

769
00:20:43,570 --> 00:20:44,610
Right?

770
00:20:45,230 --> 00:20:47,740
But the experiment never happened.

771
00:20:47,740 --> 00:20:50,610
I don't know my dad's phone's address.

772
00:20:51,030 --> 00:20:53,530
I want to confirm something.

773
00:20:54,620 --> 00:20:56,950
How did I catch you?

774
00:20:57,660 --> 00:21:00,120
Were you drinking?

775
00:21:00,120 --> 00:21:02,710
You're underage. You shouldn't do that.

776
00:21:02,710 --> 00:21:04,630
Just answer me.

777
00:21:05,130 --> 00:21:10,180
Well, I was heading back from the time machine forum meeting...

778
00:21:10,180 --> 00:21:11,300
Time machine forum?

779
00:21:11,800 --> 00:21:15,640
That's where your dad was supposed to show up?

780
00:21:15,640 --> 00:21:19,560
Yeah, my dad's calling himself Titor.

781
00:21:19,560 --> 00:21:20,850
John Titor?!

782
00:21:21,310 --> 00:21:23,310
Not John... Barrel.

783
00:21:23,310 --> 00:21:24,520
Barrel Titor.

784
00:21:24,520 --> 00:21:26,860
I told you that yesterday.

785
00:21:26,860 --> 00:21:29,860
Didn't you take a video of it on your phone?

786
00:21:32,110 --> 00:21:34,320
I had fun last night...

787
00:21:34,320 --> 00:21:37,950
It would've been more fun without Makise Kurisu, though.

788
00:21:37,950 --> 00:21:41,290
Her apple pie was man-killingly horrible.

789
00:21:41,790 --> 00:21:45,250
But Urushibara Ruka's curry was great!

790
00:21:46,170 --> 00:21:49,260
Your lab's kinda nice, you know?

791
00:21:49,260 --> 00:21:52,430
Everyone's friends, and you always seem to have fun.

792
00:21:52,430 --> 00:21:56,180
I've never felt so much like I fit in somewhere, in my whole life.

793
00:21:56,700 --> 00:21:58,470
Then you're welcome anytime.

794
00:21:59,270 --> 00:22:00,560
Come whenever you like.

795
00:22:00,560 --> 00:22:02,730
You're a lab member now.

796
00:22:03,020 --> 00:22:03,840
Yeah.

797
00:22:04,270 --> 00:22:09,070
I'll try and search for my father a little more!

